          "segment_id": "seg-8cbdf68399fbdab7751300f0",
          "segment_index": 6,
          "source_segment_id": "seg-8cbdf68399fbdab7751300f0",
          "source_text_sha256": "04a8491143f3ceffef05464450bb0b5fc70d872654cdca610140a718b432758b",
          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "needs-review",
          "text": "*CD259544564200*\nis a holder of a vast collection of documentation on this phenomenon, in various formats,\nbeing considered, among the nations of modern times, one of the most extensive in recording,\ncataloging, and classifying ufo-logical information.\n\nAs a consequence of the activity of Brazilian ufologists, some of this information has already been made available to the National Archive, such as the reports of the System for Investigation of Unidentified Aerial Objects (SIOANI), which operated from 1969 to 1972, and part of the archives of Operation Prato (1977 to 1978), both",
